tion_status","html":"source-adapted-statement"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"argument-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bde936f2b3b58ee5\" href=\"?note=bde936f2b3b58ee5\" title=\"68-df-recursive-limit-approximation\">68-df-recursive-limit-approximation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" href=\"?note=36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" title=\"68-df-turing-jump\">68-df-turing-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件现在承载原书 15.4 Limit Lemma（Shoenfield 极限引理）的集合版本。若 g 收敛，关系“之后还会改变”是 r.e.，0′ 能找每个输入的稳定阶段；反向对 0′ 的递归枚举近似作有界 oracle 模拟，原书 15.3 的有限计算稳定性保证逐点收敛。旧文件把任意 Σ₁/Π₁ 要求与未定义充分性的有限伤害相容条件拼成泛存在定理，原书没有该陈述，且它不能代替有效构造；已从正文撤下并完整保存在修订基线中。保留旧文件名供链接兼容，显示名明确为极限引理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recur